{"t": 1794109811.654292, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found. CloudWatch /ecs/reports-api (eu-west-1) shows: `ERROR export failed: ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'`. Upstream ledger 2026.11 added `currency` to every row, but reports/export.py only declared id/amount, so every export raised and the API returned 502. Fix prepared in reports/export.py: added `currency` to the CSV fieldnames. Needs a deploy to ECS to restore service."}, "ok": true}
